<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco, Fore.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco, Fore.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist said its analyst Farrokh Billimoria started coverage of Cisco Systems Inc with a strong buy rating and Fore Systems with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Billimoria expects Cisco, the computer-networking industry leader, to grow at least 50 percent a year versus the industry average of 35 to 50 percent, and he believes operating margins will average 34 percent, an industry high.</p>
<p>-- He also expects Fore, a leader in Asynchronous Transfer Mode network switching, to increase revenue by 50 percent and earnings by 45 percent.</p>
</text>
